From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seilent <github@seilent.net>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:19:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: Add SmartSens SC202CS image sensor driver

Add a V4L2 subdevice driver for the SmartSens SC202CS. The driver
brings the sensor up from its I/O and analogue supplies, reset line and
19.2 MHz MCLK, checks the chip ID and streams one 1600x1200 RAW10 mode
at 30 fps over one CSI-2 lane. Exposure, analogue gain and vertical
blanking are controls; orientation and rotation come from the firmware
node.

Signed-off-by: seilent <github@seilent.net>
